    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**核心判断**\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "分析A股是否止跌，可靠做法不是寻找某个“见底指标"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "”，而是建立“分层确认、多维共振、时间窗口、证伪"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "条件”的流程。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "止跌是过程：先看下跌速率放缓，再看结构修复，最后"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "看趋势扭转。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "单日阳线、单日资金流入或单一地量都不足以定性。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "以下仅介绍方法，不判断当前行情。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**一、先定参照系和关键位**\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "先明确基准指数：上证综指、沪深300偏权重，中证"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "2000偏小盘；日线看节奏，周线看趋势。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "关键位包括前低、箱体下沿、缺口、半年线或年线、成交"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "密集区。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "不同指数、不同周期可能给出不同结论，不能混用。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**二、分层确认流程**\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "1. **L1跌势钝化**：连续创新低后低点不再"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "下移、下影线加长、下跌斜率收敛；成交额或换手率降至"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "阶段低位；跌停家数和炸板率系统性下降。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "此时只能称“抛压衰竭”，不是底。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "2. **L2结构修复**：出现放量阳线收复5日"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "或10日均线、关键位；上涨家数占比、站上20日或"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "60日均线个股比例连续3—5日回升；前期领跌板块"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "先止跌。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "若只有指数涨、个股中位数续跌，属权重护盘型分歧。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "波动率回落、换手地量、风险溢价高位只提示“底部区域"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "”，仍需价格与量能确认。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "3. **L3趋势扭转**：回踩缩量且不破前低；"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "均线系统走平上翘；北向5日或20日累计、两融余额"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "、宽基ETF申赎、减持与回购等资金信号由流出转稳"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "政策连续性、汇率与海外流动性、盈利预期修正决定反弹"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "能否持续。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "4. **时间窗口**：日线信号需3—5个交易日"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "不被否定；周线级止跌需连续2—3周低点抬高。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "失效条件包括收盘有效跌破前低、放量破关键位、跌停"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "家数回升、创新低家数扩张、资金重新净流出。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**三、假突破与量能配合**\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "关键位是否有效，不能只看盘中，要看收盘价、突破幅度"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "和停留时间；假破回收往往比直接突破更有信息量。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "地量只是抛压衰竭的必要条件，不是充分条件；“缩量"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "止跌+放量确认”更可靠。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "反弹若缩量、不过前高或5日、10日均线，随后再放"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "量破前低，更像下跌中继。"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "政策利好当日高开低走或尾盘跳水，也应按假信号处理"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "。\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "**四、常见误判与规避**\n\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **把单日长阳或政策消息当反转**：等3—5"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "日回踩不破再确认。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **把指数横盘当止跌**：看涨跌家数、创新低"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "家数、跌停家数、站上均线比例，防止权重护盘掩盖个股"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "下跌。\n"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "id": "msg_c5619ccbb7a14fa5b4c0750cc8994f28",
        "type": "ai",
        "content": "- **把地量当底部**：地量后必须有放量阳线和"
      },
      {
        "langgraph_node": "synthesizer"
      }
    ],
    [
